course: dictionary
lesson: 15777
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: Many words have more than one meaning, and tweet is a good example. The words around it, its context, tell you which meaning the writer wants. «The robin began to tweet in the garden at dawn.» The sentence is about a bird, so tweet means the short, high sound a small bird makes.
explain: «Mia sent a tweet to her friends about the school trip.» Now tweet means a short message posted online. Ask yourself: is this about a bird, or about a message on a screen? The clues show you which meaning fits.
explain: Tweet can also be a doing word, a verb. Birds tweet, and people tweet when they post a message. To check your choice, put your meaning into the sentence. If «The bird posted a message at dawn» makes no sense, you have picked the wrong meaning.
fact: Tweet as a noun means the short, high sound a small bird makes, as in «The tweet of the sparrow woke me up.»
fact: Tweet as a noun can also mean a short message posted on Twitter, now called X, as in «She read a funny tweet.»
fact: Tweets can be seen by many people and are hard to delete, so think before you post.
fact: Many social media sites require users to be at least thirteen years old.
fact: A «viral tweet» is a message that spreads very fast to lots of people.
exercise: «The robin began to tweet in the garden at dawn.» What does tweet mean here? | A loud crash | *The short, high sound a small bird makes | A long walk in the park | A short message posted online
exercise: «Mia sent a tweet about her school trip.» What kind of tweet is this? | A small rainstorm | *A short message posted on social media | A type of warm hat | A bird's song
exercise: «Ella read the tweet on her phone and laughed.» Find and copy one word that shows tweet is a message, not a bird. | feathers | morning | *phone | sparrow
test: In «Birds tweet in the morning», what does tweet mean? | To count to ten | To fall fast asleep | *To make the short, high sound of a bird | To post a message online
test: Which sentence uses tweet to mean a message on social media? | The little bird began to tweet on the fence. | The tweet was small, yellow and fluffy. | *She sent a tweet to thank her gran for the present.
exam: Why should you think before you post a tweet? | Tweets only go to your family | *Tweets can be seen by many people and are hard to delete | Tweets are sung by birds in the morning | Tweets disappear after one minute
